The '''big banana''' is an item that is dropped by [[Ba-Ba]] in the [[Tombs of Amascut]], in which the player receives one if they dealt the most damage to her.

It is given to [[Awowogei]] after having spoken to the [[Bank Camel]], as part of obtaining the [[Ancient key (Tombs of Amascut)|ancient key]] from them. Doing so requires having completed the [[miniquest]] [[Into the Tombs]].

